From 1582f545273f2aa4eb4ee6f3a89b433f5c85c68f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean Young <sean@mess.org>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 13:04:31 +0100
Subject: media: redrat3: Ensure all urbs are suspended
Git-commit: 1582f545273f2aa4eb4ee6f3a89b433f5c85c68f
Patch-mainline: v7.4-rc1
References: git-fixes

Ensure that the learn urb is stopped before suspend.

Fixes: c49fcdde38cb ("[media] redrat3: enable carrier reports using wideband receiver")
Signed-off-by: Sean Young <sean@mess.org>
Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org
Reviewed-by: Hans Verkuil <hverkuil+cisco@kernel.org>
Acked-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>

---
 drivers/media/rc/redrat3.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/rc/redrat3.c b/drivers/media/rc/redrat3.c
index 658e223a4745..30111deb6013 100644
--- a/drivers/media/rc/redrat3.c
+++ b/drivers/media/rc/redrat3.c
@@ -1164,6 +1164,7 @@ static int redrat3_dev_suspend(struct usb_interface *intf, pm_message_t message)
 	usb_kill_urb(rr3->narrow_urb);
 	usb_kill_urb(rr3->wide_urb);
 	usb_kill_urb(rr3->flash_urb);
+	usb_kill_urb(rr3->learn_urb);
 	return 0;
 }
 
